OL,3,GNEWSAFerry passenger disruption as     
OL,4,Asailings cancelled                     
OL,6,FFerry passengers travelling on foot are
OL,7,Ffacing a day of disruption after an    
OL,8,Foperator cancelled 10 of its high-speed
OL,9,Fservices.                              
OL,11,FRed Funnel said its Red Jet service    
OL,12,Fbetween Southampton and Cowes would not
OL,13,Frun on a number of journeys on Sunday  
OL,14,Fbecause of staff shortages.            
OL,16,FAll sailings between 11:30 GMT and     
OL,17,F16:45 have been cancelled, affecting   
OL,18,Ffive crossings in each direction.      
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
