OL,3,GNEWSAFerry passenger disruption as     
OL,4,Asailings cancelled                     
OL,6,FThe operator apologised for the        
OL,7,Fdisruption and said passengers with Red
OL,8,FJet tickets for the affected crossings 
OL,9,Fcould use its vehicle ferry service    
OL,10,Finstead.                               
